{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_127_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_127","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，齊師伐莒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_127_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_127","textTraditional":"二、夏，楚子伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_127_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_127","textTraditional":"三、秋，螽。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_127_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_127","textTraditional":"四、冬，晉殺其大夫先縠。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}